  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). You give it a tabular dataset and a causal question in plain English (or Russian). It profiles the data, parses the question into treatment, outcome and other roles, runs assumption diagnostics, then recommends a causal method, gives a shortlist, or refuses, and explains why. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
